f=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9840cc84-2ded-49c8-9b37-e39813f5b1f4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9840cc84-2ded-49c8-9b37-e39813f5b1f4\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bombasto\" title=\"Bombasto\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Bombasto.png/25px-Portrait_Bombasto.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Bombasto.png/38px-Portrait_Bombasto.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Bombasto.png/50px-Portrait_Bombasto.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bombasto\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Bombasto.png/25px-Portrait_Bombasto.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Bombasto.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bombasto\" title=\"Bombasto\">Bombasto</a>, a patron in the <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong Tavern</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A rambling journal in large, loose handwriting that describes both heroic exploits and juvenile pranks. Its most recent entry is as follows.] \n</p><p><br>\nNow we was thirsty, which almost always leads to either trouble or glory. We knew that the hobgob raiders had a wagonload of beer, while all we had was a cart full of donkey shit, so I proposed that we trade them for it. We was at the top of the hill with our shit cart, and I proposed how I'd sneak down into the ravine, <a href=\"/wiki/Dame_Guisarme\" title=\"Dame Guisarme\">Dame Guisarme</a> could roll our cart down the hill into the beer wagon, and the wagon would roll into the ravine where I'd grab and make off with it. Guisarme said the whole idea was crazy, and I said sure, the best ideas always are, and then I said she had pretty eyes and she slapped me and said all right she'd do it. ...Wait, I need a fresh quill to get this writ out proper.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203314\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1848/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33042/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9815/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936276/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.141      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.141      1 -total\n 54.83%   25.299      8 Template:Icon_text\n 48.52%   22.387     19 Template:Trim\n 21.71%   10.015      2 Template:Uid\n 14.97%    6.905      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.15%    6.527      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.26%    5.657      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.72%    4.485      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.56%    4.412      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46890-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203314 and revision id 327248. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}